{
  "format": "story-pages-v1",
  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukong-and-the-tiny-tomatoes-v5-zh-Hans.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "017f6a42dc489b0ba1eb136a0f03485c86882773b8b029d3ab445b8e00a6f225",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "e0688518901c63977f8cc6e4ecc7d9499a0cfdbf57a12b2c6cfe5c78a9517443",
      "text": "悟空的\n小番茄",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "ebf17dd0caf3ff61e32edb87fc037982cc7656fb18828d402aed02bd56a5ca67",
      "text": "悟空家门口，\n有块阳光暖暖的小空地。\n“我们来种小番茄吧！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6d22f59c3166f16f80c5ab74a1fa5afa75265011446766a3cf460989a8952209",
      "text": "敖丙带来两棵小苗。\n他们挖了两个小坑。\n“你种一棵，我种一棵！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0148204f8e31fada0e66a5963c260b7a6c8386fc8c5813086d32d6008fb971ad",
      "text": "把小苗放进坑里，\n拍拍，拍拍，把土盖好。\n悟空也拍拍自己的小肚子。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4d211fc19a1af862ecb64742bc42b52a72053f5c8cd38aa7f97dc9e9b4b0f32b",
      "text": "悟空把小水壶一歪。\n“请你喝水……”\n哎呀！水浇到了鞋子上！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a9405ee6f72bdbffe83502e23a1c4ef6ecd03006ae57f27dc747a9699d448eaf",
      "text": "敖丙变出一朵小云。\n滴答，滴答，滴答。\n“温柔的小雨！”悟空说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c3c8b19017d2d95b4b4c7337f27e823d32a784e97a951efc6adfef29a2013453",
      "text": "每天，他们都摸摸泥土。\n土干了？浇一点水。\n土湿湿的？放心去玩吧！",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "40ce17b9a48485e02885f216d94ca393ae41b1c011304d73069ba9bba452c41a",
      "text": "“红了吗？”悟空问。\n他在每片叶子下面找呀找。\n敖丙指指他的小鼻子，笑了。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "628177b938295899b818df176fbbefbc01fe72dcd4cbbe7fca4f59f445082b61",
      "text": "一天天过去了。\n小黄花开了。\n“你好呀，小星星！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4a6b49aa444ca16443dbc0f01dd9e525260589a9dffd1825b625daf7be25697e",
      "text": "接着，长出绿绿的小番茄。\n“熟了吗？”悟空问。\n“还没有呢。”敖丙说。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "6835bc9294991c60f4b5c3f34f6c2b40030f195ee21f2e4c9c9ed8b7b930ebcd",
      "text": "悟空小声说：\n“请变红吧。”\n番茄静悄悄的，\n一声也不吭。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "827c612b584e2a479a7e1df9b654c42e282e4dcfa62c71ac485a0539bcf1e46a",
      "text": "浇浇水，等一等。\n绿色变成金色，\n金色变成橙色。\n“快好了！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "88275a9df55566eb8c1c40e4acdfad8b93ea86e21f5498443d7ba5605cf28a0a",
      "text": "一天早上……红了！\n亮亮的，番茄红！\n悟空跳起了小番茄舞。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c2cf1e39df39108298e4cffd21fdb4be333d46f5e5cde73fb7136fcf5a49deed",
      "text": "轻轻一拧，往上一提。\n红番茄摘下来啦！\n绿番茄留着继续长。",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "592b910a8337fcc1c7c5709edfbb20153228819202135b7a1e0b963302b9708e",
      "text": "他们洗净刚摘的小番茄。\n红红的番茄，凉凉的水。\n“现在可以尝尝啦！”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "942e29097582b727c9fd78f4eda519434aa7f4944eb87089d31994aeec95ae05",
      "text": "他们分享甜甜的番茄。\n“这是我们种的！”悟空说。\n敖丙笑了：“我们一起种的。”",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
